<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHT - Azteca seen in strong show.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHT - Azteca seen in strong show.</headline>
<byline>Ruth Morris</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's second largest broadcaster should receive a cordial welcome when it hits the New York Stock Exchange on Friday, despite carrying a heavy bundle of dollar debt, industry experts said.</p>
